WorkflowRegistry::tryUnlinkOwner
├── when the owner is linked
│   ├── given that the owner selects none pre action
│   │   ├── given that the owner does not have active workflows
│   │   │   └── it should not revert
│   │   └── given that the owner has active workflows
│   │       └── it should revert with active workflows error
│   ├── given that the owner selects pausing workflows
│   │   └── it should not revert the process
│   └── given that the owner selects removing workflows
│       └── it should not revert with an error
└── when the owner is not linked
    └── it should revert with not linked error
